'''Meftians'''<ref name="Guardians of the Whills" /> were a [[Hair|fur]]-covered [[Sentience|sentient]] [[humanoid]] [[species]] that had long [[Color|black]] and white fur. They were also slightly reminiscent of the [[Wookiee]]s.<ref name="Alien Archive" /> [[Kullbee Sperado]], a member of this species, was a gunslinger and a member of the [[Partisans]].<ref name="Guardians of the Whills" />

